window.products.push({"id":1058105,"name":"CHUN YI - Rhombus Sofa Cover 31 Stretch Sofa Slipcovers 1-Piece Couch Cover Furniture Protector Arm Chair Loveseat Coat Soft High Elastic Material, Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+W1bBJKcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elastic,polyester,spandex 1. SUPERIOR FABRIC: 85% polyester 15% spandex fabric makes our sofa covers more stretchy and durable, ensuring both good function and comfort. Protect your new sofa from daily wear and tear, spills and stains, and also give your favorite old sofa a new rejuvenated look instead of buying a completely new one. 2. FIT JUST RIGHT: Comes in 4 sizes with SOFA SIZE suitable for sofa between 72\"- 92\". Our sofa covers are stretchy to fit various kinds of sofas like lawson sofa, T-cushion sofa, high arm sofa, leather sofa and so on. You can measure your sofa in advance and compare it to our size chart. If you are not sure about how to choose, contact us and we will help you with all our heart. 3. STAY IN PLACE: Our sofa cover can cover the back of your sofa, providing all-round protection. Feature Anti-Slip Foam Strips, which can be tucked into the grooves where you needed to make the fabric more tight. Elasticized bottom will secure the slipcover stay in place firmly. For detailed installation steps, please find our install instruction in the package or feel free to contact us. 4. EFFORTLESS CARE: Not only will our sofa cover protect your sofa from accidental dirt like biscuit crumbs and daily wear and tear, but also it is very easy to clean, saving you much effort. Machine washable with similar colors. Do Not Bleach. For drying, tumble dry low and remove them promptly from dryer. 5. TIPS: With a brief style and appealing colors, our slipcovers match well for your most different styles of furniture and decoration. Due to the diverse light and monitor display, colors may slightly differ from picture and product, but please be assured that we never stop trying our best to reduce the color difference to the minimum as far as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+W1bBJKcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHUN YI","source_asin":"B07S998R3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S998R3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S998R3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
