window.products.push({"id":1058177,"name":"YoTelim Roll Up Dish Drying Rack with Utensil Holder, Foldable Over The Sink Dish Drying Rack SUS304 Stainless Steel Dish Drainer Rack Multipurpose Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712B5Gop8eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD SAFE & HEAT RESISTANT: The roll up drying rack is made of SUS304 stainless steel with non-slip rubbery grips on both ends, the sink dish rack is solid and sturdy. This sink rack is thermal resistant (up to 400°F). LARGE DIMENSION: Kitchen dish rack: 17.2(L) x 15.0(W) x 0.4(H) inches, utensil holders: 8.1(L) x 2.5(W) x 4.7(H) inches. The over sink dish rack is perfect for most kitchens, and useful for saving counter space. Please kindly measure your sink size firstly before purchasing this kitchen tools and make sure that this overlaps the sink at least an inch. MULTIPLE-USES: Not only can you dry dishes, bowls, cups, cookware, cutlery, etc., but you can use the dish drainer as a colander to wash fruits and veggies when prepping meals. You also can use the dish dryer as a resistant trivet rack, protecting your countertop from hot cookware or cookies. A large space on the last dish rack where you can put a towel or pot cover. HANGABLE & ROLL UP DISH RACK: The dishes drying rack is designed to be set over a portion of your sink, allowing you to continue using the sink. The built-in utensil basket (removable) are designed to extend counter space. The drying rack will make your kitchen look less cluttered and more neat, and keep water off your cunters. SPACE SAVING: The dish drainer can roll up and go in a drawer quickly or hang up when not in use. This rack will not take up much space and make your kitchen sink area looking neat. This small dish drying rack can be washed with a towel or scrub sponge under the faucet, easy to clean, and not afraid of oil. It is the best one of dish drainers for kitchen counter. If you need any help, please feel free to contact us and we will give you the response within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712B5Gop8eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YoTelim","source_asin":"B08XW32VQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XW32VQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XW32VQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
