window.products.push({"id":1058194,"name":"MNSRUU Round Tablecloth Animal Peacock and Plum Table Cover Round 60\" Waterproof Table Protector for Outdoor Wedding Party Dining Room Table","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MT9UPORML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"---Brand--- MNSRUU is short for My New Style \"R\" Unbeatable Unique. We're passionate about letting you add your unique styles to any part of your life through customization. With MNSRUU, easy to express your design ideas, unleash your creativity. ----Why Choose Our Product---- ▷▶ We provide a variety of custom patterns, there must be one to meet your needs. Your tablecloth can provide the perfect finishing touch to your dining table, party, kitchen, etc.– if you choose the right color. ▷▶ The right tablecloth accents not only the dominant color but also the pattern and texture, of the dinnerware plus room decor. ▷▶QUESTION & ANSWER Q: How to choose the best tablecloth size for your table? A: Regarding how to choose the correct wallpaper size, we have found several methods for your reference: First measure the rectangle tablecloth length and width of your table. Next, add twice the desired drop to each side’s dimension. First measure the rectangle tablecloth length and width of your table. Next, add twice the desired drop to each side’s dimension. ▶ Rectangle Tablecloth size needed = [ length of table + (drop x 2) ] x [ width of table + (drop x 2) ] For a casual occasion, a cloth with a drop of 8-9 inches from the side of your table is considered a comfortable drop for casual, easy dining. For more formal events, Try a 15-inch drop. For a casual occasion, a cloth with a drop of 8-9 inches from the side of your table is considered a comfortable drop for casual, easy dining. For more formal events, Try a 15-inch drop. ▶ Round tablecloth size needed = table diameter + drop x 2 For a round table, measure the diameter of your table and add twice the desired drop. For example, a 30-inch round table with a 15-inch drop would require a 60-inch round tablecloth. For a round table, measure the diameter of your table and add twice the desired drop. For example, a 30-inch round table with a 15-inch drop would require a 60-inch round tablecloth. ▷▶If you have other questions please do not hesitate to contact us. Thank you for your support!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MT9UPORML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MNSRUU","source_asin":"B09HKCRV7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HKCRV7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HKCRV7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
