window.products.push({"id":1058208,"name":"glitzhome Swivel Barstools Set of 2-27.5''Seat Height Bar Chairs Fabric Upholstered and Walnut Wood Frame Counter Height Stools for Home Bar Furniture","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sBvY5kTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Swivel Bar Stool】If you are looking for a bar stool with swivel function, our swivel bar stool must be your favorite choice. This furniture features 360-degrees rotatable seat, which allows you to enjoy the fun and convenient movement in a complete circle. And the swivel mechanism is durable for long lasting seating. it is a wonderful seat for you to have a glass of wine with your friends in your free time 【Carrying Ergonomic Design】In order to make you feel much more comfortable and safe, this counter swivel bar chair follows the ergonomic design strictly. The 27.5\" bar seat is suitable for most customers with different stature. And with the help of back rest, you can not only relax your back but also strengthen your shoulder muscles. Above all, the foot ring can help to reduce the pressure points in legs and promote the blood circulation for much foot cozy 【Soft Seat Pad】To provide you a soft and easeful seating spot, the seat cushion is padded with high resilience sponge. You can seat on this chair and keep talking with your friends for a long time. In addition, the material of the surface is made by soft PU lesther, which is breathable, odor free and environmental friendly. Even after a long-time use, it would not get any bad smell but keep its neat and soft 【Solid Construction】You do not need to worry about the durability and stability. This seat can hold up to 264 pounds. The four walnut colored bent wood legs with a built-in foot ring ensures the great support and stability. And the frame is crafted from natural walnut wood grain veneer, which features high density and non distortion to promise a long serve life. Besides, the surface is easy to clean and low-cost to maintain, quicker and more convenient 【Perfectly Match with Your House】Our product is combined with the modernist design and small size. The classic color, clean lines and simple silhouette can easily match with almost all kinds of house decoration no matter country style or beach theme. It serves not only as a piece of furniture, but also as a ornamentation for your home. And the small size allows you to put it on the kitchen, dining room, bar and outdoor for daily use. A perfect pick for small rooms short on space","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sBvY5kTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"glitzhome","source_asin":"B0C77HGWVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C77HGWVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C77HGWVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
