window.products.push({"id":1058227,"name":"Reusable Produce Bags for Plastic Free Shopping & Storage, 100% Natural Non-toxic Cotton, Washable & Biodegradable Grocery Eco Bag, Light Tare Weight,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lL6ikUm2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLASTIC FREE SHOPPING: Replace single-use plastic bags by bringing these lightweight, washable, cotton bags grocery shopping. Use them to gather all your fruit, vegetables, grains and nuts instead of disposable plastic bags. These bulk food bags are super light (total weight is under 0.5 oz) and barely register on the scales at the point of purchase. No toggles or fiddly drawstrings reduce weight further. Our Produce Bag Set comes in two sizes - 3 x Large (11.8” x 15.7”) & 1 x Small (7.9”x11.8”) MADE FROM 100% NATURAL NON-TOXIC COTTON: Eliminate toxic residue on your foods by using our chemical-free grocery bag, made from sustainable unseeded & unbleached cotton. Exposing produce to materials like plastic, silicone, paper towel and aluminium foil, can result in produce absorbing highly toxic chemicals that can leach out and end up in your body. Made from biodegradable materials, these bags will decompose within months when composted (unlike silicone and plastic). MULTIPURPOSE & EASY TO CLEAN: Our 100% natural produce bags are not only great for safely storing fresh produce, but also provides an enviro-friendly and durable alternative to store bulk foods such as nuts, grains, legumes, coffee and rice. Use the bags to strain yogurt, juice and nut milk, or store fresh bread. They can also be used to organise toys, cosmetics and household accessories. Whenever they get dirty, simply pop them in the washing machine for an easy clean (cold water). USE WITH SWAG BAGS FOR EASY STORAGE & KEEP PRODUCE FRESH FOR LONGER: For the ultimate storage combo, place these breathable cloth bags directly into your SWAGs to keep smaller, loose items perfectly contained, or transfer contents into your SWAGs when you get home. Our collection of SWAGs has a patented multi-layer design, scientifically proven to keep produce fresh for 2 weeks or more (in some cases up to 4 weeks) after being placed in the refrigerator. ETHICALLY MADE & DESIGNED WITH LOVE: Our zero waste sustainable products are ethically made in India by a certified SEDEX manufacturer who ensures our entire supply chain is approved under Ethical Trading practices. All our materials are sustainably sourced, and are polyester-free, nylon-free, pesticide-free, unbleached and food-safe. MADE TO LAST YEARS & COMPOSTABLE: Our high quality produce bags are hand-made from 100% natural unbleached and unseeded cotton. They are designed to last for several years before being fully composted at the end of its very long life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lL6ikUm2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Swag 100% Natural","source_asin":"B09JYSRRJR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JYSRRJR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JYSRRJR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
