window.products.push({"id":1058235,"name":"Innsky Air Fryer 5.8QT, 1700W Air Fryer for Roasting, High-Tech Cooking appliances & Oilless Cooker with LED Touchscreen, 7 Cooking Presets, Preheat &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XnsE75dRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nutrition & Healthy Eating - Deep frying adds a lot of calories and Trans Fats which may increase the risk of Heart Disease, Diabetes and Obesity. Innsky air fryer cooks by 360° circulating hot air around the food and makes the food produce a crispy layer via the Maillard effect with 85% less oil. It doesn't deconstruct the good nutrients. Meanwhile, keep the food being delicious the same as deep frying. Vesatility & Saving Space - With a range of 180 to 400 ℉, this air cooker allows you grill, bake, and roast food. Not only can you make traditionally fried foods, but it’s also great for vegetables, proteins like chicken wings and drummettes, and appetizers like coquettes and feta triangles. Even desserts like brownies and blondies are perfectly baked in this air fryer. Maximize your culinary potential! No sweat, No tears - Easy-to-read LED touch screen with 7 presets allows you to cook different delicious effortlessly. Cooking is fast and free from splattering oil vapor all over your kitchen countertop. All removable parts go into the dishwasher. Washing by hand is easy too. No sweating cook in hot summer and troublesome cleanup after cooking. Auto Shut Off & Memory - This air fryer is designed to be shut down automatically when time is up which means you can set your air fryer and then forget about the food until it’s ready to eat. Halfway through cooking, you can also remove the basket to shake or add seasoning without interrupting the preset time or temperature. Strive To Be Your Best - Provide healthier fried food which makes it a great choice for Thanksgiving Day and Christmas Day, etc. Comes with a recipe book including 32 recipes, it will give you a few extra ideas if you are not sure what to make with this air fryer. Innsky Brand is committed to 100% customer satisfaction, 90-day no reason money-back, 2 year warranty and life time support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XnsE75dRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Innsky","source_asin":"B07SX25QQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SX25QQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SX25QQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
