window.products.push({"id":1058240,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon 500-Thread-Count Pima Cotton Sheet Set - King, Fog Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XXJoDtdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Elegant looks and a luxurious feel come together in these 100% Pima Cotton solid color sheet sets Available in a range of fashionable colors that include white, canvas, Flintstone blue, fog grey and mineral green. The sheets have a super silky hand and a lustrous shine. The fine-weave 100-percent Pima cotton makes these sheets soft. silky and elegant. Durable yet soft, the linens are perfect for adding a sumptuous feel to the bed without breaking the bank in the process. This set includes one fitted sheet, one flat sheet and two pillowcases. The fitted sheet is fully elasticized for a secure fit and its 15-inch deep pockets fit deep and pillow top mattresses. For easy care, it washes up in the machine and tumbles dry. They are available in full, queen, king and California king sizes. Extra pillow cases are available and sold separately. An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com Super-soft sheet set made of 500-thread-count 100% Pima cotton. view larger Pima Cotton Sheet Set What You Need to Know: Made of 500-thread-count 100% Pima cotton Made of 500-thread-count 100% Pima cotton Super silky hand and lustrous shine Super silky hand and lustrous shine Set includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases* Set includes fitted sheet, flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases* 15-inch-deep pockets on elasticized fitted sheet 15-inch-deep pockets on elasticized fitted sheet Variety of colors available Variety of colors available Machine washable Machine washable An assortment of inspiring earth-tone colors available. view larger Pinzon 500-Thread-Count Pima Cotton Sheet Set Seriously Soft Indulge in the sensation of seriously soft with this sheet set by Pinzon. The opulent ensemble combines elegant simplicity with 500-thread-count fine-weave 100% Pima cotton for a durable yet extremely silky and soft-to-the-touch experience. Ideal for a master bedroom or notable guest room, the superior-quality sheet set hangs with an elegant drape, offers lustrous shine, and makes for an alluring bed make-over. You deserve to feel pampered at the end of the day. Pinzon makes it possible. Variety of Sizes and Colors Choose from four sizes: Full, Queen, King, and California King. Each sheet set includes a fitted sheet, a flat sheet, and two pillowcases*. The fitted sheet provides 15-inch-deep pockets to accommodate both deep and pillow-top mattresses, as well as stretchy elastic all the way around to ensure a secure fit. The sheet set comes in a range of earth-tone colors including White, Canvas, Flintstone Blue, Fog Grey, and Mineral Green. Each long-lasting color resists fading and will blend beautifully with existing solid or patterned comforters, decorative throw pillows, and surrounding bedroom decor. * Extra pillowcases available (sold separately). Machine Washable For easy cleaning, the 500-thread-count Pima cotton sheet set is machine-washable and can go in the dryer--or be hung out on the clothesline to dry on a warm sunny day. Pinzon Bedding A few simple upgrades in the bedroom can create the welcome effect of a new beginning--whether it's January 1st or a Sunday. Such a simple pleasure, really--fresh, clean sheets, fluffy pillows, and cozy comforters. You can feel like a five-star guest in your own home with bed linens by Pinzon. Fold back the covers, slip into sweet happy dreams, and wake up refreshed. It's a brand-new day. For the master bedroom or a charming guest room, the Pinzon brand provides the high-quality bedding needed for a restful night of sleep. The Pinzon brand includes everything from memory foam mattress pads, mattress and pillow protectors, sheets, and duvet sets to luxurious Permaloft pillows, which you can never have enough of--especially when enjoying breakfast in bed (sometimes you just have to indulge). About Pinzon Invite Amazon.com's Pinzon products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Pinzon products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly test each Pinzon item and rely on feedback from our customers to help us deliver the highest quality. Check out all of our Pinzon products, including bedding, towels, and more, and you'll find something for all occasions at the best values. With a selection that continues to grow, the Pinzon brand is set to become a part of your lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XXJoDtdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00CL5TIIM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CL5TIIM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CL5TIIM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
