window.products.push({"id":1058354,"name":"Rocky Mountains National Park Magnet by Classic Magnets, Discover America Series, Collectible Souvenirs Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m+UTO9jsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Did you visit Rocky Mounatin National Park but didn't bring home a souvenir? Don't fret... we've got you covered! This 3D soft flexible rubber refrigerator magnet is the perfect memento of your trip. The magnet measures 0.100\" thick and measures 2.8\" x 3.3\" (seven square inches). This colorful Classic Magnet is perfect for any refrigerator or metal surface and makes a great gift or Souvenir! It's also ideal for that traveler that loves to collect souvenir patches, keychains, shot glasses, or other traveling memorablia. And better yet... it is made right here in the U.S.A!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m+UTO9jsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Magnets Made with Pride in the USA","source_asin":"B07BY86HKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BY86HKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BY86HKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1058355,"name":"Heavy Duty Laundry Bag 115L, Sturdy Laundry Backpack Bag Extra Large, Dorm Room Essential for Guys, Khaki Laundry Bag Backpack for Camp, XL Laundromat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DKOTaJDyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our laundry bags extra large heavy duty is the best solution for organizing your laundry and with the soft padded shoulder straps, your trek to the laundry room just got a lot cooler. 【Soft Padded Shoulder Straps】Instead of kicking or rolling your laundry bag, the backpack-style laundry bag for camp makes organizing and carrying laundry a breeze. Features padded and breathable mesh shoulder straps that can offer cushioned comfort, carrying our laundry bag with straps is comfortable. The adjustment straps can fit a wide variety of people, as well as the \"X\" reinforced stitching which can prevent it from ripping during the way to the laundromat or up and down the stairs. 【Laundry Bags Extra Large Heavy Duty】Our laundry backpack measures 28’’H X 15’’L. Features an extraordinary extendable design on the top, the large laundry bag can be extended to 40’’ and TOP capacity up to 115L, which is much TALLER & BIGGER than normal size, enough for holding 3 batches of laundry easily. You don't have to make special trips back to the car. The laundry bag backpack also features a front pocket with 15”H X 11.2”L to keep your laundry detergent and other accessories together. 【Premium Material & Smart Design】The heavy duty laundry bag is made of high-quality 600D tearing-resisting oxford, lightweight but durable. The backpack laundry bag also has an expandable wide opening that makes loading and unloading effortless. With a drawstring closure and a strap with buckle on the mouth top of the extra large laundry bag, you can stay assured your belongings won’t spill out of the bag. Further sewn with reinforced stitches on all sides, our cloth laundry bag can avoid rips. 【Multi-Purpose】The laundry backpack extra large is suitable for a dorm room or apartment living where laundry needs to be transported. You can also use it as storage bags for blankets, toys, or other stuff in a very organized manner. Hands-free carrying makes the large college laundry bag perfect as a travel bag for hiking, camping, or picnics. The laundry backpack hamper is also a collapsible laundry bag that you can easily fold and store in any drawer when you are not using it. 【Perfect Gift】Our laundry dorm bag is a combo of a laundry bag and a door laundry hamper, you can use it as you like. With a hanging loop, the laundry hamper backpack allows you to fit it on the back of the door. It’s also easy to clean and air dry. Built for convenience, our laundry basket backpack is one of the first items a family or college will need on laundry day. It’s a perfect gift for your family on Christmas, Thanksgiving, birthdays, or just because to makes life easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DKOTaJDyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Azhido","source_asin":"B09993BC5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09993BC5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09993BC5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
