window.products.push({"id":1058382,"name":"TIYOLE Reed Diffuser,Reed Diffuser Set, Oil Diffuser & Reed Diffuser Sticks, Home Decor & Office Decor, Fragrance and Gifts, 5.1oz (Green Bamboo)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612RqOGAvcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relaxing and refreshing reed diffuser scent: \"Gardenia\" is a fresh and elegant plant aroma.The most obvious smells are tuberose, gardenia, orchid, jasmine.It can help lift your mood and create a serene atmosphere and relieve your work stress after a long day.The\"Free Gardenia\" smells lightly scented,the scorpion flower blooms in the bottom of the bottle, exuding a fresh and high-grade aroma, and the fragrancIf you are fantastic of the simple style and minimalism, you will fall in love with it. Aromatherapy:The natural aromatic reed diffuser set will absorb natural aromatic oil and allow it to evaporate slowly into the air.Whenever you smells the fragrance, you feel comfortable, pleasant and relaxed.Always keep a happy mood. Reed diffuser:The room fragrance diffuser scent itself, is not overpowering but fills your house with a deliciously elegant fragrance.minimalism bottles are highly ornamental wherever they are placed. Excellent Gift Idea:Convenient &long lasting.You could reuse the nice-looking glass bottle that this comes in instead of throwing it away each time.No heat is needed to enjoy aromatic diffuser reeds. Sandalwood diffuser:Can adjust the intensity of the scent reed diffuser by changing the number of aroma sticks.Besides,the aroma sticks can be reused,it is also safe and environmentally friendly.A bottle of 100 ml aromatherapy can last for 4-11 weeks to perfume your environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612RqOGAvcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIYOLE","source_asin":"B07MQV76DV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MQV76DV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MQV76DV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1058383,"name":"Simply Charmed His and Hers Magnetic Wine Charms & Stemless Glass Markers - Set of 12 - Fun Birthday, Hostess or Housewarming Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U2ceeWVvL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"stocking stuffers wine tasting party kit CLEVER GIFT FOR ANY WINE LOVER: Whether you love to host and entertain or know someone who does, these unique wine glass markers make a memorable impression at any event. We have heard from many delighted wine enthusiasts that our identifiers were \"Great conversation starters\" and \"The hit of the party!\" PERFECT FOR ANY OCCASION: Our set of 12 charms for both guys and gals arrives directly from Amazon in an elegant clear-top gift box. They make a great Christmas gift, a lovely hostess or birthday gift, or a great stocking stuffer for your wife, sister, friend, aunt or girlfriend. Pair with a bottle of cabernet or chardonnay for a unique holiday hostess gift. WHY MAGNETIC CHARMS? Simply Charmed's modern glass charms solve 2 problems encountered with regular hoop markers: they do not dangle or clank when you take a drink, and they work on the ever so popular stemless wine glasses. They even work on martini glasses, champagne flutes & beer mugs, and your guests are just going to love them! HANDMADE IN THE USA: Our small family owned business hand crafts our charms in the Midwest. We have been pleasing discerning shoppers that enjoy using and gifting quality memorable items for over 5 years. Our mission: To ignite conversation and create experiences amongst wine enthusiasts, new acquaintances, or old friends with two strong magnets and one small charm, which also serve to identify your drink. COMMITTED TO EXCELLENCE: From day 1 we have chosen to create the best quality wine accessories possible. We expanded our designs in response to our customers' requests for specific themes such as Thanksgiving, snowflakes, and wedding & bridal gift sets. We are confident our charms will delight your guests, but if not, just contact us for a full refund or replacement. So with that guarantee, add a set of charms to your cart now, and select a nice bottle of wine for when they arrive. Cheers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U2ceeWVvL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Charmed","source_asin":"B013Q1AYNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013Q1AYNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013Q1AYNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
