window.products.push({"id":1058508,"name":"KASSO Stovetop Espresso Maker, 3 Cup Aluminum Moka Pot for Classic Espresso, Italian Coffee Maker for Home and Camping, Easy to Operate & Quick Cleanu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wV43HwaxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 Cups Espresso Coffee Maker: This classic moka espresso machine will give you all the coffee recipes, latte, cappuccino, traditional espresso and all that in use with our moka pot. Make up to 6 espresso cups of rich espresso. Ideal for friends of 1 to 3 people to drink. Enough for a warm breakfast or a midnight nightcap with friends. Elegant & Durable Design: This espresso coffee machine is made of a food-grade aluminum body with a pressure valve for coffee essence to be extracted efficiently to make favorable coffee. A soft-touch imitation wood handle and the classic octagonal design have both classical shapes and modern lines to be a great addition to your modern home. Easy to Use: Unscrew and remove the funnel filter from the base. Fill the base with water just below the safety valve. Fill the funnel filter with espresso ground coffee. Screw the top to the base securely. 3-5 minutes on low or medium heat until it’s stopped gurgling, you will get a rich and high-quality espresso coffee. Suitable for all cooking over the open fires and electric stove. Easy to Carry: This manual coffee machine is made of a material strong enough yet lightweight enough to be easily stuffed inside your bag or luggage without breaking or bending. Brew the best-tasting Italian espresso with utmost ease wherever and whenever you are. Easy to Clean: Carefully wash all the components with clean water after every use and let the espresso maker air-dry in the ventilated areas or wipe them dry. Do not use sandy materials and ACID detergent for cleaning, as this will damage the surface brightness. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wV43HwaxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KASSO","source_asin":"B09DRZ5M1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DRZ5M1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DRZ5M1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
