window.products.push({"id":1058564,"name":"Victorinox Swiss Army Cutlery Fibrox Pro Knife Set, 4-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":154.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mJy9GQZoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A TRUSTED FAVORITE Preferred by both home chefs and culinary professionals, the 4-Piece Victorinox Fibrox Chef's Knife Set can handle nearly every kitchen task imaginable. Crafted with comfortable handles, superior weight and balance, and razor sharp edges that rarely require re-sharpening, these knives are essential tools for every kitchen. KEY FEATURES High-quality, lightweight European steel. High-quality, lightweight European steel. Handle design reduces hand and wrist fatigue. Handle design reduces hand and wrist fatigue. Fit for dicing, mincing, chopping, slicing, and shredding. Fit for dicing, mincing, chopping, slicing, and shredding. Long, sloping curved blade that “rocks” for effortless mincing and chopping. Long, sloping curved blade that “rocks” for effortless mincing and chopping. Flat spine for extra power to slice through hard-skinned items. Flat spine for extra power to slice through hard-skinned items. Textured handle for a secure and comfortable grip no matter the hand size. Textured handle for a secure and comfortable grip no matter the hand size. National Sanitary Foundation (NSF) approved and dishwasher safe. National Sanitary Foundation (NSF) approved and dishwasher safe. CARE AND USE Be good to your knives and they’ll be good to you. Following these simple guidelines will ensure that you get the longest life out of your knife! CLEANING Victorinox Swiss Army recommends washing all knives by hand. For best results, hand wash your knives with a soapy cloth and dry immediately.  While Fibrox knives are dishwasher safe, we recommend hand washing as dishwashers are designed to spray water at a relatively high pressure, which can jostle the silverware and cause the knives to collide, dulling the edge. SHARPENING For optimum performance, knives should be honed after every couple of uses. Proper and frequent use of a honing steel will keep your knives sharper and performing at their best. FORMERLY FORSCHNER In 1937 Victorinox began selling cutlery in America through a Connecticut distributor called R.H. Forschner & Co. A well-known manufacturer of butcher scales, Forschner soon became the exclusive U.S. distributor for Victorinox knives, and was the name by which Victorinox knives were known.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mJy9GQZoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victorinox","source_asin":"B004IEBTZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004IEBTZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004IEBTZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1058565,"name":"Jokari Healthy Steps Avocado Pro 5-in-1 Multi-Tool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qcsBSQUoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Did you know that the avocado is sometimes referred to as a \"nutrient booster\" because it helps to absorb alpha and beta-carotenes from other foods? Well, if you didn't, it certainly offers yet another reason to eat more avocados, and Jokari's Healthy Steps Avocado Pro is here to make it easy to enjoy that next avocado more quickly. This clever little gadget opens, pits, slices, scoops and mashes - all with one handy tool - which will definitely speed up prep time and help to keep clutter to a minimum in your kitchen gadget drawer. The serrated cutting edge makes quick work of opening the avocado and the tip at the end of the cutting edge removes the pit. The only decision left is which of the other features to take advantage of next: use the slicer to create even slices for a salad or use the scooper to remove the meat and the masher to whip up a batch of zesty guacamole! And, if you're including avocados in your diet as part of your efforts to eat healthier, check out Jokari's complete collection of Healthy Steps Portion Control tools designed to cook and serve correctly-sized single portions without the hassle of measuring or counting calories. For over 40 years, Jokari has held a special place in its heart for gadgets; today, they specialize in providing affordable solutions to common problems faced by consumers. From unique kitchen gadgets and household storage and organization solutions to their Healthy Steps kitchen tools designed to help with portion control and healthy eating, Jokari is committed to creating useful and often crazy looking \"thingamajigs\" that are fun, colorful and easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qcsBSQUoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jokari","source_asin":"B003Y3B98M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003Y3B98M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003Y3B98M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
