window.products.push({"id":1058579,"name":"Lock Box for Medication Safe, Medicine Lock Box, Black Lockable Storage Box for Home Safety, Locking Container for Kitchen Food Safe, Phone Jail Lock ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TS2mCdVuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Lock Box for Medicine/Snack Food/ Kids Toys Storage Safe *Note:The box with lock comes in 3 sections that you need to assemble before use. What can you do with our lock box? Medicine Lock Box for Safe Medication Storage Medicine Lock Box for Safe Medication Storage Our medicine lock box can be stored medication and household First Aid Kit to keep the pills or medicine away from the kids. And due to its large capacity, it is great for different-sized pills or medicine bottles storage. Refrigerator Lock Box for Food Refrigerator Lock Box for Food The lockable storage bins use food-grade material, you may use it as a lockable storage containers for treat food like sweets, candy, chocolate, drinking, or any you want to protect snack food. Cell Phone Jail Lock Box / Tablet Safe Organizer Storage Cell Phone Jail Lock Box / Tablet Safe Organizer Storage Have you always be interrupted by your phone message, FB news push during you're studying/ working? Let the phone lock box Help you out! The lockable box is great for personal items, kids toys, especially for the electronics safe, and even it could help you to kick the electronics addiction, cut down your screen time. How to set the code? *Before set a new password, please do not close the locking storage box cover, This is to have a chance to open when you set the password not succeed. 1. The default code is 000. Please open the lid, make the 3 numbers in a straight line above. Then, you could find the backside of the lock on the top of the lid's backside. The initial lever is on the A position. 2. New Code Setting: Switch the lever from point A to point B, then set your new password, please let 3 numbers be in straight point line. 3. Finally, pull the trigger from B position to A position, set the password successfully. * If you want to change a new password, turn the dials to your last working code and follow the above steps to set the box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TS2mCdVuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOLYHY","source_asin":"B0BW2J1TGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW2J1TGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW2J1TGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
