window.products.push({"id":1058795,"name":"Rechargeable Alarm Clocks for Bedrooms, ZOOS Simple Digital Alarm Clock Led Desk Clock for Bedroom, Sound Control, Dual Alarm, Snooze, Dimmable, 16 Tu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iV+uFxQQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy Operation & Best Gifts】- LED digital alarm clock is designed with absolute simplicity in mind, simple and intuitive buttons and matching English instruction manual, the alarm clock is super easy to set up, no annoying pressing or repeated pressing, if you don't know how to set up, you can also read the manual in detail before use. Digital alarm clocks for bedrooms can be given for men, adults and kids as birthday and Christmas gifts. 【Rechargeable & Sound Control】- 2 Working Modes: ①The screen is always on when the power is connected by the USB cable; ②Sensitive Sound control or touch to wake up the screen. Built-in high quality safe rechargeable battery, when the power of the alarm clock is exhausted, it takes 2-3 hours to be fully charged, and the digital clock can work in the voice-activated mode for 25-30 days after being fully charged. 【Stepless Adjustable Brightness / Volume】- There are 2 black rotary buttons behind the digital alarm clock for adjusting the volume and screen brightness. The brightness can be adjusted between 0% and 100% as needed, and the volume can be adjusted: 55dB-118dB. Easy to operate, simple and convenient. 【Dual Alarm Clock & 5 Minute Snooze】- 2 sets alarm clocks can be set for couples with different habits, and can also be used as backup alarm clock for waking up heavy sleepers. \"\"Snooze\"\" button is located above the alarm clock for bedroom, When you are sleepy and do not want to open your eyes, touch it and the led digital clock will remind you in an infinite loop every 5 minutes, you can short press other button to close alarm and no longer sound. 【16 Tunes & Nap Function】- The simple digital desk clock comes with 16 tunes, you can choose them as alarms, or play them as music at your leisure. There are 7 options for the nap time: 5-15-30-45-60-75-90 minutes, you can set it according to the length of your lunch break, and the alarm clock will wake you up on time. 【12/24H & Week & Daylight Saving Time】- LED digital clock screen shows time(12H / 24H), week, clear and large number for easy and comfortable to read, especially for kids and seniors. There is a \"\"DST\"\" setting button on the back of the Led alarm clock, switching it to \"\"ON\"\" and the time will be automatically advanced by one hour, and the \"\"DST\"\" icon will appear on the screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iV+uFxQQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOOS","source_asin":"B0B7XRNBX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7XRNBX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7XRNBX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
