window.products.push({"id":1058802,"name":"v Elena Luxury Jacquard Curtain Panel with Attached Waterfall Valance & Scarf 54 by 84-Inch Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JLRCZHTGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring the elegance of the royal family to your home, with these jacquard panels with attached waterfall valance and two tone attached scarf that adds a touch of modern style to your home decor. Featuring an incredible array of colors to choose from, this beautiful window panel set is the perfect way to dress your home with beauty, sophistication and up-to-the moment style. Sweeten up your decorating with these lustrous, easy-to-install curtains. Hang two or more window panels on a standard or decorative rod for optimal coverage. Available in many colors. Panels sold separately and measure 54-inch wide by 84-inch lengths with 18-inch attached waterfall valance and two tone attached scarf. Rods sold separately. Imported, 100-percent Polyester. Machine wash, cold water, gentle cycle, do not bleach, light iron if needed. PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 PANEL with ATTACHED VALANCE & Attached Scarf.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JLRCZHTGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"V","source_asin":"B08LMNRMG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LMNRMG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LMNRMG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1058803,"name":"Trudeau Board Room Desk Mug, Pink Leatherette","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v30NSeMUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This stainless steel double wall insulated desk mug, with lid, will keep your hot drink hot, for up to one hour. It has a convenient design and includes a comfortable, stay cool drinking lip. The durable, leather-like sleeve is hand washable. Mug holds up to 16-ounce of your favorite beverage and features a non-slip base. Pink leather like accents. 5 year warranty. By Trudeau a company that develops visionary products. Add an exciting flavor to your day, with Trudeau. Style, eloquence and innovation - Trudeau, letting you savor life's little moments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v30NSeMUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trudeau","source_asin":"B001R6GCYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001R6GCYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001R6GCYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1058804,"name":"Global G-11L-10 inch, 25cm Left-Handed Yanagi Knife 10\" Sashimi, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dON5+HJ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The slightly longer curved ergonomic handle provides a comfortable grip and features 7 signature black dots which represent the 7 Samurai codes of honor and moral principles.  The beautiful hammered finish applied to the patented Cordova 18 core (Chromium, Molybdenum, Vanadium and Carbon) produces air pockets which help release food while cutting, giving the blade non-stick properties. Legendary industrial designer Komin Yamada brings a new age of innovation to Global cutlery with Sai, unifying function and design, these distinctive Japanese knives combine revolutionary ergonomic handles with triple-layered steel blades that maintain their exceptionally sharp edges. The first new cutlery line produced by Global in more than 25 years, Sai blends the Japanese company's tradition of craftsmanship with modern technological advancements. The knives combine three layers of steel: a core of patented, ultra-hard Cromova 18 Sanso stainless-steel alloy and two outer layers of more flexible 18/8 steel for added strength and resistance to rust. Professional-quality blades are ice-hardened and tempered to increase hardness, resist corrosion and maintain long-lasting sharpness. Each blade is hand-hammered to create hollow air pockets that reduce drag, allowing the blade to glide through food without sticking. 12.5-degree blade edge is mirror-polished by hand for exceptionally long-lasting sharpness. The perfectly balanced handle has an ergonomic thumb rest for a smooth, efficient cutting motion and steady, comfortable grip. Made in Japan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dON5+HJ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Global","source_asin":"B00005OL4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005OL4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005OL4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1058805,"name":"L'AGRATY Knitted Weighted Blanket - 60\"x80\" 20lbs Cooling Chunky Knit Heavy Blanket for Adults Braided Crochet Throw Thick Cable Yarn Knit Decorative ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R6moJfBEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MORE BREATHABLE】: The knitted weighted blanket has the same weight as normal weighted blanket. At the same time, knitted weighted blankets have a series of advantages that normal weighted blankets do not have. Firstly, knitted weighted blankets are more breathable, because there are many small knitted holes on the surface of blankets, and the air can directly circulate through the small holes, while normal weighted blankets are filled with polyester fibers and have poor breathability. 【NEVER LEAK BEADS】: When using normal weighted blankets, we always worry that the bed will be covered by glass beads after waking up in the morning. Now that we have knitted weighted blanket, we no longer have to worry about this problem. Because there are no glass beads in the knitted weighted blanket.The knitted weighted blanket is made of very thick polyester yarn and is not filled with glass beads, so there will never be a problem of glass beads leaking. 【THE WEIGHT DISTRIBUTION IS MORE EVEN】: the weight of the normal weighted blanket comes from glass beads, and the weight of the whole blanket is uneven due to the uneven distribution of the glass beads. The weight of the knitted weighted blanket comes from each rope, and the thickness of each rope is the same, so the weight distribution of the entire blanket is also uniform. 【PROTECT YOUR DOG】:Knitted weighted Blankets are more SECURE.The dog can bite through the blanket,if you use a traditional weighted blanket,the GLASS BEADS will leak out,and the dog may swallow the glass beads,which can be dangerous.Knitted Weighted Blankets have NO GLASS BEADS,there is no danger to any pet. 【BETTER DECORATION EFFECT】: normal weighted blankets are simple in shape and cannot be used as decorations, but knitted weighted blankets can be used as decorations to decorate our rooms. Knitted weighted blanket has luxurious appearance and unique design.We can spread it on the bed, sofa, chair to make our living environment unique. 【MACHINE WASHABLE】: The knitted weighted blanket can be machine washed. And compared to normal weighted blankets of the same size and weight, knitted weighted blankets are smaller and more convenient to store. When you don’t want to use this knitted weighted blanket, you can easily put it in a cabinet or a box, which is very convenient. And it doesn't take up space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R6moJfBEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L'AGRATY","source_asin":"B0BR6L881P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR6L881P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR6L881P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
