window.products.push({"id":1058902,"name":"ZLCRX Stretch Sofa Cover Printed Couch Covers for 1 Cushion Couch Slipcovers for Sofas Armchair Elastic Universal Furniture Protector with One Free Pi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c5sZDAszL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Four Seasons Decoration Choosing different styles of sofa cover in different seasons will bring a beautiful effect to the house, and the mood will suddenly see the light. Two pillow cases Includes two pillowcases of the same style (not including pillow core). If you want more, you can also buy pillowcases from this link. Soft Stretchy Material It is made of comfortable, soft, and elastic material, suitable for most types of sofas. Anti-slip Foams In order to reduce the movement or slippage of the sofa cover, we equip each sofa cover with 9 non-slip foams. The foam stick can be firmly inserted into the back arm and sidearm cushions until it feels comfortable. Premium Fabric Our couch cover adopts high premium fabric, soft and comfortable. Read more 360°no dead angle, all-round package, refused to shift, \"The elastic polyester fiber fabric has a sanded surface, which is thick, durable, and elastic. The non-slip all-inclusive sofa cover can be reliable only if it can be covered. This sofa cover can be seamless with your sofa. Three benefits of all-inclusive non-slip sofa cover 1. Simple laying 2. Protect the sofa 3. Four seasons decoration\" Read more ZLCRX The sofa cover protects your sofa or sofa from stains, dust, and damage. Ideal for families with children and pets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c5sZDAszL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZLCRX","source_asin":"B08R5Z29S7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R5Z29S7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R5Z29S7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
