window.products.push({"id":1058910,"name":"Chocolate Lab Labrador Dog Breed Acrylic Christmas Tree Holiday Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51z5lHubTXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"HOLIDAY CHEER TO SHARE: Put your own spin on holiday traditions with our heirloom-quality ornaments. Available in a variety of themes and fandoms, these cheerful ornaments have a personal feel and make a versatile holiday decoration. DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: Crafted from high quality clear acrylic, our ornaments are printed on one side with the festive design shown. Unlike glass bulbs, our ornaments are shatterproof, making them perfect for families with kids or pets. Hanging cord included. Dimensions 3.0\" (7.6 cm) x 3.6\" (9.1 cm). FUN FOR KIDS, TEENS AND ADULTS: Suitable for all ages, these durable ornaments are great for accenting Christmas decorations, personalizing for loved ones, gift swaps, or just admiring. Perfect as holiday party favors, goodie bag fillers, team gifts, or anyone on your Nice list. An officially licensed product of Howard Robinson. A Graphics and More product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51z5lHubTXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRAPHICS & MORE","source_asin":"B07GV3NSX4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GV3NSX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GV3NSX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1058911,"name":"Ollygrin Meat Grinder Electric Stainless Steel, Meat Grinder Electric Sausage Stuffer, Meat Grinder Maker Heavy Duty 2600W Max With 2 Blades, 3 Plates","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716dT493BwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Concealed Storage Box] This Electric Meat Grinder with a hidden storage box is a must-have for any kitchen. Not only does it prevent loss of meat grinder accessories, but it also makes your kitchen more organized and visually appealing. With compact dimensions of 14.12\"x12.52\"x7.07\", this meat grinder is easy to store and saves valuable space in your kitchen. Whether you're a seasoned chef or just starting out, this Electric Meat Grinder is perfect for grinding meat to perfection every time. [3-IN-1 Meat Grinder] This meat grinder comes with 2 stainless steel blades (plus a spare), 3 cutting plates (7mm/5mm/2mm in diameter), a sausage stuffer tube and kubbe kit, as well as a meat pusher. With these accessories, you can easily transform the machine into a meat grinder, sausage stuffer maker, or kubbe maker, making it a versatile addition to your kitchen. By using this meat grinder, you can prepare healthy and delicious meals for you and your family, all while saving time and effort. [3-Stage Extrusion Technology] This electric meat grinder features a 3-layers auger that is designed to keep the meat cool and preserve the integrity of the meat fibers. In the development of this product, we deliberately upgraded the technology of the meat grinder to prevent gray streaks from appearing in the minced meat as much as possible. Not only does this ensure a chewy and firm texture in the ground meat, but it also helps keep your meals healthy. [Powerful Electric Meat Grinder] With Ollygrin's 100% pure copper motor rated up to 350W and a max locked power of 2600W, this meat grinder has the power to grind through various meats and vegetables (including beef, pork, chicken, venison, and duck) without animal tendons or bones. The efficient motor can grind up to 3 lbs of meat per minute, saving you time in the kitchen. This electric meat grinder is an essential tool for all your grinding needs. Voltage: 120V | Frequency: 60Hz. [Easy to Use and Clean] Once the meat grinder is installed, simply plug in the power supply and turn on the switch to start grinding. If anything gets stuck, the \"REV\" button can quickly solve the issue. All meat grinder attachments are removable and easy to clean. The stainless steel blades, plates, and BPA-free plastic parts can be cleaned in the dishwasher, while other accessories should be washed by hand using water (under 122°F or with neutral detergent) and dried quickly with a towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716dT493BwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ollygrin","source_asin":"B09PV8192P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PV8192P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PV8192P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1058912,"name":"Lodge Pizza/Roasting Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3147XVYDQ9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description The one thing that probably discourages more people from purchasing and using cast iron is maintenance. Like carbon steel woks, cast iron cooking pieces require \"seasoning.\" To many this is a mysterious or overly time-consuming process. Even if you treasure fond memories of eggs and pancakes cooked in grandmother's ancient, blackened skillet, you might have no idea how to turn your new pan into such a treasure. Fortunately Lodge has come out with the new Logic line, which has been evenly coated on all surfaces with an electrostatic spray of vegetable oil. Next the cookware is put into an extremely high temperature industrial oven which bakes the coating into the surface. Not only will you be spared the time and effort of seasoning, but also the new piece you buy will look and perform better than if you had seasoned it at home. Just like that heirloom pan you will find that even pineapple upside down cake doesn't stick to this surface. Bake a pizza with delicious golden crust, and keep it hot at the table with this wonderful pan. Use it to roast vegetables too! Amazon.com There are lots of fancy cookware materials out there but cast iron still trumps them all with its even heating, heat retention, price, and duration. Its these traits that make Lodge cookware favored by both indoor chefs and campfire cooks alike. The caveat is being able to lift cast iron cookware and, at 9 pounds, this pan will give most chefs a workout. The 14-inch diameter of this pan is specifically designed for baking thin-crust pizzas but the pan is equally as useful for roasting vegetables or whole nuts and browning pork chops. Two loop handles make it easy to grip this hefty pan and haul it out of the oven. While it usually takes years of cooking to burn on the prized finish that makes cast-iron cookware smooth and stick-free, the Logic line of cookware comes pre-seasoned to save you some work. Cast iron pans in this line are coated in a vegetable oil, which is then baked on in a hot industrial oven to obtain that blackened patina and silky surface. Logic cookware has plenty of fans, including the editorial staff at Good Housekeeping , who cited it as one of the best new products of the year at the 2003 Good Buy Awards. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3147XVYDQ9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B00008GKDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1058912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008GKDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008GKDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
